      <p>In the age of "Quishing" (QR Phishing), trust is everything. Our QR codes are "Static"—meaning they lead directly to the data you input without any intermediate tracking redirects. This transparency builds trust with your users. We recommend always providing a short text description near your code (e.g., "Scan to view menu") so users know exactly where they are going before they click.</p>

